lly cool.<br /> <br /> What\u2019s Silverhawks?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-26T06:40:55-07:00","id":1415530,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1414999-terra-firma?p=1415518#post1415518\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What\u2019s Silverhawks?</div> </div> </div> </div>I too watched this as a kid. It wasn't anything groundbreaking, but it was kinda cool.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SilverHawks\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/5/5e/Silverhawks_Logo.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=index&amp;utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SilverHawks\" target=\"_blank\"> SilverHawks - Wikipedia </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SilverHawks\" target=\"_blank\"> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SilverHawks </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8890-nullapostle","name":"NullApostle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-26T12:38:35-07:00","id":1415587,"title":"","content":"1985's <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ThunderCats_(1985_TV_series)\" target=\"_blank\">ThunderCats</a> (land), 1986's <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SilverHawks\" target=\"_blank\">SIlverHawks</a> (air/space), and 1987's <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TigerSharks\" target=\"_blank\">TigerSharks</a> (sea) formed a sort of conceptual trilogy, and were all created by Rankin/Bass. They had a lot of the same voice actors. The 2011 ThunderCats reboot implied that all three took place in the same shared universe.<br /> <br /> Of the three, ThunderCats is the only one that gained a lot of traction and is still something we talk about 30-odd years later, but the others were fun too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-26T14:50:27-07:00","id":1415603,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NullApostle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1414999-terra-firma?p=1415530#post1415530\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I too watched this as a kid. It wasn't anything groundbreaking, but it was kinda cool.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SilverHawks\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SilverHawks</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4\" data-vbnamecard=\"4\">IanWatson</a> that sounds really cool.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-27T18:20:13-07:00","id":1415764,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1414999-terra-firma?p=1415451#post1415451\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am writing some ideas for some 80s cartoon series of books to play with Thundercats, He-man, Silverhawks and Transformers style characters, but I will watt for Aberrant as I am using some of the aberrant power system to set some of this ideas. Each book would present a new kind of character based on a 80s cartoon.<br /> <br /> I also have some ideas for Beast like characters, so we would play with one of 3 kinds, antropomorphic beasts (Thundercats), human beast hybrid (werewolf, centaur, etc) or intelligent beasts (possibly shaping your own body). But it\u2019s on a very early stage...</div> </div> </div> </div>See, I'd love to see some rules for something like <i>Archer</i> or <i>Venture Brothers</i>. Maybe an evil take on the <i>$6 Million Dollar Man </i>featuring Barry the Cyborg <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y-KzH54vZO4\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y-KzH54vZO4</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-27T19:23:37-07:00","id":1415772,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>johntfs</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1414999-terra-firma?p=1415764#post1415764\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> See, I'd love to see some rules for something like <i>Archer</i> or <i>Venture Brothers</i>. Maybe an evil take on the <i>$6 Million Dollar Man </i>featuring Barry the Cyborg <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y-KzH54vZO4\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y-KzH54vZO4</a></